# CurveScout.com v1.4.6 Audit Report

## Status

Passed. This build repairs the missing Roadbook section without changing the stable search/map/product layout.

## Root cause fixed

The v1.4.4 roadbook renderer used `shortRoadbookText()` in the inline riding-order card renderer, but the helper was missing from the runtime bundle. The error interrupted `renderSelected()` before the full Roadbook section could populate.

## Repairs

- Added `shortRoadbookText()` helper.
- Added `ensureRoadbookVisible()` watchdog.
- Wrapped inline and full roadbook rendering in recovery logic.
- Updated tests so missing roadbook runtime helpers fail validation.

